@investmentSimuoation_HostAddress = http://localhost:5140

### 1. Get All Investment Products
GET {{investmentSimuoation_HostAddress}}/api/products
Accept: application/json

### 2. Filter Products by Category
GET {{investmentSimuoation_HostAddress}}/api/products?category=Government Bonds
Accept: application/json

### 3. Filter Products by Risk Level
GET {{investmentSimuoation_HostAddress}}/api/products?riskLevel=Low
Accept: application/json

### 4. Search Products
GET {{investmentSimuoation_HostAddress}}/api/products?search=energy
Accept: application/json

### 5. Simulate Empty State (returns [])
GET {{investmentSimuoation_HostAddress}}/api/products?simulateEmpty=true
Accept: application/json

### 6. Simulate Error State (returns 500)
GET {{investmentSimuoation_HostAddress}}/api/products?simulateError=true
Accept: application/json

### 7. Simulate Loading State (delays 2 seconds)
GET {{investmentSimuoation_HostAddress}}/api/products?simulateDelayMs=2000
Accept: application/json

### 8. Get Product By ID (Success)
GET {{investmentSimuoation_HostAddress}}/api/products/treasury-yield-30d
Accept: application/json

### 9. Get Product By ID (Not Found - 404)
GET {{investmentSimuoation_HostAddress}}/api/products/invalid-id
Accept: application/json

### 10. Preview / Simulate Investment Calculation (Success)
POST {{investmentSimuoation_HostAddress}}/api/investments/simulate
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "productId": "treasury-yield-30d",
  "amount": 1000.00
}

### 11. Preview Investment Calculation (Validation Error: Below Minimum $100)
POST {{investmentSimuoation_HostAddress}}/api/investments/simulate
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "productId": "treasury-yield-30d",
  "amount": 25.00
}

### 12. Create New Investment (Success - 201 Created)
POST {{investmentSimuoation_HostAddress}}/api/investments
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Idempotency-Key: test-req-client-001

{
  "productId": "treasury-yield-30d",
  "amount": 1500.00,
  "investorName": "John Flutter",
  "fundingSource": "Savings Account",
  "idempotencyKey": "test-req-client-001"
}

### 13. Create Investment with Duplicate Idempotency Key (Duplicate Prevention - 200 OK)
POST {{investmentSimuoation_HostAddress}}/api/investments
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Idempotency-Key: test-req-client-001

{
  "productId": "treasury-yield-30d",
  "amount": 1500.00,
  "investorName": "John Flutter",
  "fundingSource": "Savings Account",
  "idempotencyKey": "test-req-client-001"
}

### 14. Create Investment (Validation Error: Below Minimum Amount)
POST {{investmentSimuoation_HostAddress}}/api/investments
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "productId": "fixed-deposit-90d",
  "amount": 50.00
}

### 15. List All Created Investments (Portfolio)
GET {{investmentSimuoation_HostAddress}}/api/investments
Accept: application/json

### 16. Get Investment by Reference Number
GET {{investmentSimuoation_HostAddress}}/api/investments/INV-SAMPLE-001
Accept: application/json

### 17. Reset In-Memory Investments
POST {{investmentSimuoation_HostAddress}}/api/investments/reset
Accept: application/json
